"Los fulani son el grupo nómada más"},{"text":"grande del mundo. Durante más de","width":0.36907216099330353,"x":0.5587628917971625,"height":0.017507448588332086,"y":0.9127906983928425},{"y":0.8924254633002764,"height":0.01745825712955551,"text":"1,000 años, han influido en la política,","width":0.4,"x":0.5587628905979382},{"x":0.560824749348893,"height":0.020348837066330727,"text":"el comercio y la religión de África","width":0.34226803152901786,"y":0.8750000002749742},{"width":0.32164948381696423,"height":0.016175768050717076,"x":0.5608247453080126,"text":"Occidental. Como los primeros","y":0.8561046511697383},{"y":0.8356164379963581,"width":0.36288657924107137,"height":0.01772763900080576,"x":0.5608247537471619,"text":"africanos occidentales en seguir el"},{"x":0.5567010299414926,"width":0.36907216099330364,"text":"islam, lo difundieron a través de las","y":0.8154069770265635,"height":0.01744185946431487},{"x":0.5587628905979382,"height":0.017506277436310946,"width":0.4,"y":0.79796511683761,"text":"yihad y formaron un poderoso imperio"},{"y":0.7775987105348833,"text":"en el siglo XIX.","x":0.5608247412283401,"width":0.15463917759486612,"height":0.01745942828157654},{"text":"Se les conoce por varios nombres:","width":0.3608247419084821,"height":0.016174596898695937,"y":0.7412790697683334,"x":0.5608247469581299},{"y":0.7194767442357979,"text":"fulani o fula (del hausa), peul o peulh","height":0.01904058033761058,"width":0.38556699916294646,"x":0.5587628936917226},{"y":0.7005813955911757,"width":0.27010307965959823,"height":0.018999587711454158,"x":0.5587628904588607,"text":"(francés, del wolof), fulbe"},{"y":0.6831395348664437,"x":0.5587628843316995,"width":0.3752577427455357,"height":0.015988372200252066,"text":"(anglicanizado de fulfulde\/pulaar) y"},{"y":0.662771958031118,"text":"fallata\/fellata (de kanuri, usado en","height":0.01746059943359768,"x":0.5587628883653465,"width":0.3608247419084821},{"width":0.16494845145089276,"x":0.5608247454085742,"y":0.6438356167421708,"text":"Chad y Sudán).","height":0.0175015920597541},{"width":0.38556699916294646,"x":0.5608247505952572,"text":"Por tradición, los fulani son pastores,","y":0.6046511633118624,"height":0.01744185946431498},{"x":0.5606251796438381,"width":0.3467688685825894,"y":0.5864544099886437,"text":"desplazándose con su ganado en","height":0.018823549883870916},{"width":0.32164948381696434,"y":0.5668604653986564,"text":"busca de hierba fresca y agua.","x":0.5587628900502807,"height":0.01744185946431509},{"y":0.5494186046581104,"height":0.015988372200251955,"text":"Conocidos por su profundo","width":0.2845360804966518,"x":0.5608247456279627},{"height":0.02051280910790121,"width":0.40662343052455363,"text":"conocimiento de la naturaleza, muchos","y":0.5281342451336701,"x":0.5606034052393849},{"text":"aún viven así, mientras que otros se","width":0.37319587053571424,"height":0.017727639000805873,"y":0.5100725218902884,"x":0.5587628848094626},{"text":"han asentado en pueblos. Viven en","x":0.5587628840271309,"height":0.01613126120002495,"width":0.36494845145089283,"y":0.49113618067044984},{"y":0.47219983917801445,"width":0.38556699916294646,"height":0.01617225382618137,"text":"casas sencillas y visten ropa colorida","x":0.558762888315434},{"text":"con estampados. Hoy en día, muchos","width":0.3917525809151785,"height":0.01744185946431498,"y":0.45203488414865656,"x":0.5587628799032356},{"y":0.43243177920871356,"x":0.5585781973943938,"width":0.40252169363839285,"height":0.020924981614450222,"text":"de ellos son comerciantes influyentes."},{"text":"Las familias fulani son muy unidas,","y":0.39389534933761006,"height":0.017466455962175664,"width":0.36494845145089283,"x":0.5587628840271309},{"y":0.3745559621444011,"text":"enseñando a los niños la cortesía, el","x":0.5605639733389545,"width":0.3778642229352679,"height":0.02359197218508413},{"height":0.016173425746674908,"text":"trabajo duro y el orgullo por su cultura.","y":0.35737308594938133,"x":0.558762891538073,"width":0.4041237095424106},{"height":0.01744185946431498,"y":0.3372093026079588,"text":"La música, la narración y la danza","x":0.5587628917033897,"width":0.35051545061383926},{"text":"desempeñan papeles importantes en","x":0.5587628979411358,"y":0.31829170059976386,"width":0.38969070870535716,"height":0.017464112889660988},{"height":0.015051367588335252,"y":0.3006138510843851,"width":0.10735497174944197,"text":"sus vidas.","x":0.5586936492180374},{"x":0.5587628996967047,"y":0.26017441888702864,"text":"Lamentablemente, durante siglos ha","width":0.3793814174107143,"height":0.01744185946431487},{"text":"habido conflictos entre agricultores","y":0.24254633325424013,"x":0.558762899187569,"width":0.3711339983258928,"height":0.016174596898695937},{"width":0.3587628696986608,"y":0.22238372125621464,"x":0.5587628985939684,"height":0.01744185946431498,"text":"sedentarios y pastores nómadas y"},{"height":0.020333942533211857,"width":0.4023814174107143,"text":"agricultores. Los agricultores acusan a","y":0.20088656660278048,"x":0.5585874922350466},{"x":0.5567010394165361,"y":0.18734891235751971,"width":0.38144328962053575,"text":"los nómadas de dañar sus cosechas","height":0.014685971231637285},{"text":"con sus rebaños, mientras que los","width":0.35876286969866067,"x":0.5587628950475768,"height":0.019075717203661302,"y":0.164244186096263},{"x":0.5587628863139844,"height":0.01772763900080576,"y":0.14665592277027795,"text":"nómadas se quejan de robos de","width":0.33402061244419645},{"y":0.1264534887852845,"x":0.5587628851709201,"height":0.01744185946431487,"width":0.41237112862723213,"text":"ganado, problemas de acceso al agua y"},{"width":0.39793812779017856,"height":0.015988372200252066,"text":"movimiento. Estos problemas pueden","y":0.10901162794420538,"x":0.5608247555121272},{"text":"resolverse con paz, comprensión y","width":0.36288657924107137,"y":0.08863819487463287,"x":0.5587628987093611,"height":0.017466455962175664},{"width":0.07492728969029017,"height":0.016427491193428678,"y":0.06882113818848512,"x":0.558412644430298,"text":"apoyo."}]